title: InterviewDay1
---
Don Contento: Alright, first question… Who would you consider to be your idol?

-> Robert F. Kennedy Sr
	Don Espresso: HE’SAFED!
	GAME OVER
	<<stop>>
-> Al Capone
	Don Contento: Same!
-> Mickey Mouse
	Don Contento: Finally, a sense of humor!
	You have curried favor with Don Contento

Don Lacrimoso: What would you do if you felt like you didn’t wanna get out of bed?
-> I’d push myself to get out all the same
    Don Contento: My kinda guy!
    Don Bill: The uncaring cruelty of the universe shrinks in the face of the indomitable human spirit
    You have curried favor with Don Contento and Don Bill
    Don Lacrimoso: Like it’s that easy…
    You’ve lost favor with Don Lacrimoso
-> I’m not sure.
	Don Lacrimoso: Alright…
-> I’d probably have to be dragged out…
	Don Lacrimoso: Yeah, same…
	You have curried favor with Don Lacrimoso

Don Calvo: How’s my hair look?
-> Pretty good!
	Don Calvo: Oh, thanks!
	You have curried favor with Don Calvo
-> Very realistic!
	Don Calvo: Uh, thanks? // *Quietly* Is he fucking with me?
-> That’s hair?
	BANG!
	GAME OVER
	<<stop>>

Don Espresso: YOUWANTSOMECOFFEE?!
->YEAH!
	Don Espresso: HEREYAGO
	You have acquired coffee and curried favor with Don Espresso
-> Sure…
    Don Espresso: WHYSOGLUMABOUTIT?!
	You have lost favor with Don Espresso
-> No thanks, I’m good.
    Don Espresso: TOTALLYGETITIT’SNOTFOREVERYONE

Don Bill: How ya doin’?
-> Pretty good
	Don Bill: That’s nice You have curried favor with Don Bill
-> Alright
	Don Bill: Oh, alright
